# Walkthrough - User-Scoped Data Isolation (Multi-Tenancy)

We have successfully updated the database schema and all backend controllers to enable multi-tenancy. Now, every registered user has completely isolated data. 

## What Was Changed

### 1. Database Schema (`schema.prisma`)
- Added a `userId` field and a relation to the `User` model on the following models:
  - `Setting` (one-to-one)
  - `Supplier`
  - `Category`
  - `Warehouse`
  - `Product`
  - `SaleTransaction`
  - `SupplierInvoice`
  - `Customer`
  - `Expense`
  - `Loan`
  - `Staff`
- Configured composite unique indexes to prevent global collisions:
  - `@@unique([userId, name])` on `Category` and `Warehouse`
  - `@@unique([userId, barcode])` on `Product`
  - `@@unique([userId, receiptNo])` on `SaleTransaction`
  - `@@unique([userId, invoiceNo])` on `SupplierInvoice`

### 2. Backend Controllers
We updated all of the CRUD methods in the controllers to ensure they only read, create, update, or delete data belonging to the logged-in user (`req.user.id`):
- [settingController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/settingController.js): Modified to upsert default user settings when requested and scope `clearData` transactions to the user.
- [supplierController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/supplierController.js): Modified to scope suppliers to the user.
- [categoryController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/categoryController.js): Modified to scope categories to the user.
- [warehouseController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/warehouseController.js): Modified to scope warehouses to the user.
- [productController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/productController.js): Modified to scope products, search by barcode, and barcode validation during import.
- [saleController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/saleController.js): Modified to count sales by user when generating receipt numbers, check product ownership, and decrement stocks.
- [customerController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/customerController.js): Scoped all customer actions and balance increments.
- [expenseController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/expenseController.js): Scoped expenses.
- [loanController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/loanController.js): Scoped loans.
- [staffController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/staffController.js): Scoped staff.
- [supplierInvoiceController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/supplierInvoiceController.js): Modified to count supplier invoices by user for custom numbers and check warehouse/supplier ownership.
- [dashboardController.js](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/src/controllers/dashboardController.js): Modified to scope dashboard stats and low-stock/expiry alerts.

### 3. Database Applied
- Re-ran the database generator and successfully applied schema changes via Prisma.

